{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silk Soar is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aefde95bc7444ddd48ff129d4c5c72a6.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Silk Soar, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3277320?t=1759233241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/05fef6b138b82ae8c6f4c0a16bd5f42b4a1fe7a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759233241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/d2be4015912df1f83ed7765b96965815939242e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759233241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/d2be4015912df1f83ed7765b96965815939242e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759233241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3527160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silk Soar is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/93d755e131a7b11e87278d351f474a35.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aefde95bc7444ddd48ff129d4c5c72a6.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/4b18d9aa91e64ff89c8f84a17b23e37c.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.poster.avif?t=1759233241\" width=617 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/533dcd6c19d2b5d578c5aabccc166d7c.webm?t=1759233241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Silk Soar, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Devony Boskell","Stout Heart Games","Sarah Elliott"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/40dddf6585c2b63b20462b7012dcbd804ded9bef/hea